  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your savage brutality leaves your foes battered and bruised.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Improved Rending Fury<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When rend an opponent, you deal 1d6 points of bonus damage for each of the natural weapons you use to rend that hits that opponent. You may choose to forfeit this damage and instead deal 1 point of Strength or Dexterity damage to the target for every 1d6 points of damage you would have dealt with this feat. Neither hit point damage nor ability damage is multiplied on a critical hit.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc181\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
